        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "马上 + predicate",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "马上 says an action is imminent or should happen immediately. It does not report that it has already happened.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我马上来。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ mǎshàng lái 。",
                "meaning": "I will come right away.",
                "audio": "297d6a7a8ee0c08afc25a805f2bac351baec320bc6bf7b92e31d1cdd6bc7ec8b"
              },
              {
                "text": "马上要下雨了。",
                "pinyin": "mǎshàng yào xiàyǔ le 。",
                "meaning": "It is about to rain.",
                "audio": "408defa82eb9de762c052d4827e8822093b4bacb2b074b6c8e9519787a1180b7"
              }
            ]
